---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="section-padding bg-white">
  <div class="container-nord">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-nord-500 via-nord-600 to-nord-700 px-8 py-16 md:px-16 md:py-20">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-white/5 rounded-full -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2 blur-3xl" />
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-48 h-48 bg-white/5 rounded-full translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 blur-3xl" />
        <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/4 w-32 h-32 bg-nord-400/30 rounded-full blur-2xl" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <span class="inline-block text-nord-200 font-medium text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Kontakt</span>
        <h2 class="section-title text-white mb-6">Bereit für Ihr digitales Upgrade?</h2>
        <p class="text-nord-100 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Lassen Sie uns über Ihr Projekt sprechen. In einem unverbindlichen Gespräch finden wir heraus, wie wir Sie am besten unterstützen können. Ganz ohne Druck, ganz ohne Verpflichtung.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href={`${base}kontakt`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-white text-nord-600 font-medium text-base hover:bg-nord-50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg">
            Kostenloses Erstgespräch vereinbaren
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:hallo@nordflag.de" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-white/30 text-white font-medium text-base hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
            hallo@nordflag.de
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-nord-200 text-sm mt-6">
          Antwort innerhalb von 24 Stunden. Versprochen.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
